  "en": {
    "kind": "CD of 1933–1934 recordings",
    "about": [
      "A compilation of recordings by the members of the “Famous Quartet of Piraeus” (Vamvakaris, Batis, Pagioumtzis, Delias), including versions from the summer of 1934 released here for the first time. “Otan pino toumbekaki” was recorded on 24 November 1933. The ensemble, which Vamvakaris joined in 1934, popularised the bouzouki-and-baglamas line-up."
    ]
